{
  "name": "Epilepsy Europe",
  "remarks": [
    "=======================================================================",
    "SYNTHEA MODULE: Epilepsy — European Epidemiology Edition",
    "=======================================================================",
    "Calibrated to EU/ILAE data; REPLACES the US epilepsy.json.",
    "",
    "BUG FIXES vs original epilepsy.json:",
    "",
    "  Fix 1 — Entry probability 10% → 1.7%.",
    "           Original: 10% of all patients entered epilepsy pathway.",
    "           EU adult active epilepsy: ~0.6-1.0%. Target Synthea lifetime",
    "           onset (full-life simulation): ~1.7% → ~0.85% seizure disorder",
    "           after gender filter. 10% was ~6× the EU rate.",
    "",
    "  Fix 2 — SUDEP rate 10%/cycle → 0.1%/cycle.",
    "           Original: 10% per treatment cycle (15 weeks avg) → 97% 10-year",
    "           SUDEP mortality. Real EU SUDEP: ~1-3% lifetime in epilepsy patients",
    "           (~0.1%/year). New 0.1%/cycle → ~3.4% 10-year SUDEP risk ✓.",
    "",
    "  Fix 3 — Post-stroke epilepsy pathway added in Ages_55_Plus.",
    "           Reads stroke_eu == true (set by stroke_europe_v2.json).",
    "           ~8% of stroke survivors in 55+ group develop epilepsy (ESO 2021).",
    "           Structural: Ages_55_Plus delay → Post_Stroke_Epilepsy_Check",
    "           → Post_Stroke_Seizure_Prob (8% → Seizure_Disorder) or normal path.",
    "",
    "  Fix 4 — Medications updated to ILAE 2022 / EAN EU first-line AEDs.",
    "           Removed: diazepam (acute rescue only, NOT chronic AED),",
    "                    clonazepam (2nd line benzodiazepine).",
    "           Added:   levetiracetam 40% (broad-spectrum, EU preferred new-onset),",
    "                    lamotrigine   35% (focal + generalized, safe profile).",
    "           Kept:    carbamazepine 25% (focal seizures, established).",
    "",
    "  Fix 5 — Added epilepsy_eu = true attribute after Epilepsy ConditionOnset",
    "           for use by other modules.",
    "",
    "CALIBRATION REFERENCES:",
    "  ILAE 2022: European epilepsy prevalence 0.6-0.8% adults.",
    "  Forsgren et al. 2005: Epilepsia — EU lifetime incidence ~1.5-2%.",
    "  ESO 2021: Post-stroke epilepsy 8-10% within 5 years.",
    "  SUDEP: Thurman et al. 2014 — ~1.16/1000 epilepsy patients/year.",
    "======================================================================="
  ],
  "states": {
